# Installed by the base metapackage as /usr/share/initramfs-tools/modules.d/@DISTRO_ID@-thunderbolt.
# The initramfs loads the modules listed here at its start, before the disk encryption passphrase
# prompt. Without this the thunderbolt driver started only once the disk was unlocked; when that
# took 20 s or more (11 s was still fine), the driver found the firmware's DisplayPort tunnel to a Thunderbolt
# display inactive, tore it down and built no new one, and the display stayed dark until replugged
# (Apple Studio Display on the Legion laptop, 2026-10-15). Harmless on a machine without
# Thunderbolt: the driver loads and finds nothing.
thunderbolt
